{"934260":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"GroundFall","steam_appid":934260,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groundfall is a minimalist sandbox game where you fly bush airplanes in an open wilderness setting!  Attempt to take-off and land your STOL airplane at rugged and remote locations as you complete missions to explore, camp, build, survive, and more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly aerial missions while working to keep yourself and your airplane in one piece.  When you're not flying, you'll be busy surviving! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/934260\/extras\/0573d628585926331b8ec9db1d0426a1.poster.avif?t=1745775969\" width=798 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/934260\/extras\/0573d628585926331b8ec9db1d0426a1.mp4?t=1745775969\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/934260\/extras\/cbbb41f15d45498fc641b2d22dc179a6.avif?t=1745775969\" width=600 height=75 \/><\/span><strong>Flight Features:<\/strong> <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based Flight<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airplane Damage\/repair System <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airplane Fueling<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flaps <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water Assisted Landings (hydro-plane) <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain-based Friction (wet grass, mud, snow, ice) <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival &amp; Crafting Features:<\/strong> <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons, tools, and resources can be crafted, found, or unlocked<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft primitive tools and weapons <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Campsites, Shelters, Cabins, and even  Runways <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather, harvest, and hunt food and other resources to manage energy, hunger, and thirst  (optional)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Features:<\/strong> <\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world maps and missions <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush ground vegetation and trees <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated seasonal weather with rain, snow, lightning <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Volumetric fog\/clouds <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI wildlife<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GroundFall is in constant development, future updates will included new maps, improvements, mission objectives, and more  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Groundfall is a minimalist sandbox game where you fly bush airplanes in an open wilderness setting!  Attempt to take-off and land your STOL airplane at rugged and remote locations as you complete missions to explore, camp, build, survive, and more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly aerial missions while working to keep yourself and your airplane in one piece.  When you're not flying, you'll be busy surviving! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/934260\/extras\/0573d628585926331b8ec9db1d0426a1.poster.avif?t=1745775969\" width=798 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/934260\/extras\/0573d628585926331b8ec9db1d0426a1.mp4?t=1745775969\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_im